    },
    {
      "subId": "48003",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "4800301"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "4800301": {
            "id": "4800301",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Amber",
            "text": "You gotta focus on your technique when you're gliding.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "4800302"
            ]
          },
          "4800302": {
            "id": "4800302",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Amber",
            "text": "If you wanna try again, just let me know.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "4800305"
            ]
          },
          "4800305": {
            "id": "4800305",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Let me get myself ready.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "4800306"
            ]
          },
          "4800306": {
            "id": "4800306",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Amber",
            "text": "Sure. But you gotta be 100% ready to glide."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "48202",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "4820201"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "4820201": {
            "id": "4820201",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Amber",
            "text": "Great, you're here! Did you have a good read-through of the gliding manual? Got all the rules down?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "4820204"
            ]
          },
          "4820204": {
            "id": "4820204",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Amber",
            "text": "Sounds like it was a real drag. I would know, I've been there...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "4820205"
            ]
          },
          "4820205": {
            "id": "4820205",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Amber",
            "text": "The gliding manual is super dry... I couldn't get into it at all. Don't tell Jean though...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "4820206"
            ]
          },
          "4820206": {
            "id": "4820206",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Really? Hmm... Paimon thought there were some pretty cool stories in the gliding manual.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "4820207"
            ]
          },
          "4820207": {
            "id": "4820207",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Amber",
            "text": "Cool stories? Oh, you must mean the example cases in the Appendix.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "4820208"
            ]
          },
          "4820208": {
            "id": "4820208",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Amber",
            "text": "Some of them I like. My favorite one is about the illegal Anemo Slime take-off.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "4820209"
            ]
          },
          "4820209": {
            "id": "4820209",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Amber",
            "text": "Apparently, if you pop an Anemo Slime and take off in the burst of wind, it shoots you up really, really high... I really wanna try it!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "4820210"
            ]
          },
          "4820210": {
            "id": "4820210",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "No, not that story. Paimon meant the one with the little bird who wanted to learn to fly.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "4820211"
            ]
          },
          "4820211": {
            "id": "4820211",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Amber",
            "text": "Ah... What...?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "4820212"
            ]
          },
          "4820212": {
            "id": "4820212",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Amber",
            "text": "Lemme take a look... Shoot, this is the storybook I used to read as a kid!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "4820213"
            ]
          },
          "4820213": {
            "id": "4820213",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Amber",
            "text": "Oops, sorry! I put both books in the same pile and must have grabbed the wrong one when I was leaving.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "4820214"
            ]
          },
          "4820214": {
            "id": "4820214",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "How in the heck do you confuse a bedtime story with an instruction manual?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "4820215"
            ]
          },
          "4820215": {
            "id": "4820215",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Amber",
            "text": "Ahh... This is so embarrassing...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "4820216"
            ]
          },
          "4820216": {
            "id": "4820216",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Amber",
            "text": "It's because... Maybe deep down inside, that fairytale is the thing that truly taught me how to glide...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "4820217"
            ]
          },
          "4820217": {
            "id": "4820217",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Amber",
            "text": "\"What you lacked was not wind. It's courage that's allowed you to become the first flying birds of this world.\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "4820218"
            ]
          },
          "4820218": {
            "id": "4820218",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Amber",
            "text": "Reading that gave me the courage to glide, to become an Outrider, and to become the Gliding Champion of Mondstadt.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "4820219"
            ]
          },
          "4820219": {
            "id": "4820219",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Amber",
            "text": "...But anyway, let's get back to the exam!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "4820220"
            ]
          },
          "4820220": {
            "id": "4820220",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Amber",
            "text": "Don't be nervous, just glide like you're used to.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "4820221"
            ]
          },
          "4820221": {
            "id": "4820221",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Amber",
            "text": "Okay then. You just need to follow the <color=#00E1FFFF>marked route</color> to the finish.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "4820222"
            ]
          },
          "4820222": {
            "id": "4820222",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "I'm ready."
          }
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}